{
    "_comment": "#016b-mini inference spec: identical to #016/config/infer.json except `checkpoint` points at the mini run dir. The probe's purpose is the per-step rollout regression metric, not AR-corpus headline; AR-corpus pass still runs each eval and is logged but not gated on.",
